WEBVTT

00:11.658 --> 00:16.158
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

00:16.997 --> 00:20.458
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

00:22.252 --> 00:26.752
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

00:27.424 --> 00:31.261
<i>But I will never give in</i>

00:31.303 --> 00:35.803
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

00:43.106 --> 00:47.606
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

00:56.161 --> 01:00.661
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

01:02.125 --> 01:06.625
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

01:09.216 --> 01:12.344
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

01:12.427 --> 01:16.927
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

01:17.641 --> 01:22.141
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

01:31.821 --> 01:36.321
EPISODE 02
BUCCIARATI APPEARS

01:32.656 --> 01:34.032
<i>Giorno Giovanna.</i>

01:34.157 --> 01:37.160
<i>Son of DIO Brando.</i>

01:37.577 --> 01:40.496
<i>To DIO, women were merely
a means to an end,</i>

01:40.539 --> 01:41.998
<i>an object of sustenance.</i>

01:42.249 --> 01:46.749
<i>And yet, miraculously,
DIO did not kill Giorno's mother.</i>

01:47.212 --> 01:51.299
<i>She lived, and fifteen years ago,
gave birth to one improbable son.</i>

01:51.883 --> 01:56.220
<i>Giorno's mother was
a vision of unblemished beauty</i>

01:56.304 --> 01:59.098
<i>Motherhood, however,
was a matter of struggle.</i>

01:59.182 --> 02:02.393
<i>After Giorno's birth,
she and her son lived in Japan,</i>

02:02.519 --> 02:05.730
<i>where she left Giorno
at home in favor of</i>

02:05.772 --> 02:07.815
<i>a nightlife of glamour
and bacchanalian revelry.</i>

02:07.857 --> 02:09.900
You're gonna just leave him there?

02:10.360 --> 02:12.070
Isn't he like two?

02:12.112 --> 02:14.405
Oh, he'll be fine.

02:14.698 --> 02:18.576
Like hell I'm gonna let
some little kid take away my freedom.

02:18.743 --> 02:20.953
SHIOBANA

02:19.369 --> 02:20.975
<i>Countless nights,
Giorno awoke to a vacant room.</i>

02:23.331 --> 02:27.543
<i>The fear and desperation
that must have terrorized his soul.</i>

02:28.086 --> 02:32.256
<i>All he could do was tremble.
Giorno knew crying was futile.</i>

02:35.218 --> 02:38.846
<i>When Giorno was four,
his mother entered into marriage.</i>

02:39.347 --> 02:43.267
<i>And her new Italian husband
had made Giorno an Italian citizen.</i>

02:43.393 --> 02:44.769
Um…

02:46.187 --> 02:48.147
Now who do we have
hiding over here?

02:48.523 --> 02:49.982
Come on, Haruno.

02:50.025 --> 02:52.027
Come with Daddy for the pictures.

02:52.402 --> 02:54.195
Mommy's waiting too.

02:56.615 --> 03:01.115
<i>But when his wife wasn't looking…</i>

03:02.329 --> 03:06.249
You're always trying to skulk around
and sneak a peek of my face…

03:06.333 --> 03:08.043
Annoying little twerp!

03:08.501 --> 03:10.127
<i>But reality was quite different.</i>

03:14.299 --> 03:15.508
What's the matter?

03:16.593 --> 03:19.220
Oh, you want some bread.

03:19.262 --> 03:20.429
Here, take it.

03:20.472 --> 03:22.807
Shit, what a depressing kid.

03:22.891 --> 03:26.269
<i>But Giorno was a constant observer
of human expression thanks to</i>

03:26.311 --> 03:28.813
<i>the very man who stood before him.</i>

03:29.939 --> 03:31.231
<i>Giorno had become
the perfect target.</i>

03:31.274 --> 03:34.443
<i>An easy mark for frustrated
and disillusioned youth.</i>

03:35.654 --> 03:38.657
Whoa, what's wrong, Giorno?

03:38.740 --> 03:40.950
You tripped,
and there's nothing in the road?

03:42.869 --> 03:45.371
Hey, punks,
move your asses and get home.

03:45.622 --> 03:46.664
Si.

03:46.790 --> 03:47.874
Let's go.

03:48.041 --> 03:48.666
Yeah.

03:48.667 --> 03:50.835
Go back to your country,
Japanese freak.

03:51.127 --> 03:52.878
The kid never even
tries to fight back…

03:53.129 --> 03:54.296
He's a freakin' weirdo.

03:54.297 --> 03:57.800
<i>Soon, he was seeing himself
as the scum of the earth.</i>

03:58.134 --> 04:00.302
<i>It would be only a matter of time</i>

04:00.345 --> 04:03.681
<i>before he would become
another crooked member</i>

04:03.765 --> 04:05.516
<i>of the Neapolitan underbelly</i>

04:06.643 --> 04:09.187
<i>But little did Giorno know that
a single incident</i>

04:09.270 --> 04:11.272
<i>would change his life forever.</i>

04:19.447 --> 04:21.449
Merda, where'd that bastard go?

04:21.491 --> 04:22.950
Don't let him go! Get him!

04:23.034 --> 04:25.077
He won't get very far
with those injuries!

04:25.161 --> 04:27.746
He couldn't have hid
in someone's house, could he?

04:27.831 --> 04:30.500
Make sure you check the ground!
There's gotta be blood.

04:30.542 --> 04:33.378
You go straight. We'll go this way.

04:34.629 --> 04:36.172
Ey, ragazzo.

04:36.464 --> 04:39.216
You see an injured guy around here?

04:39.300 --> 04:41.969
He's tall and has black hair.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.889
He went that way.

04:44.931 --> 04:46.349
Over there?

04:46.391 --> 04:48.726
Well, he won't be moving very fast!

04:48.810 --> 04:50.353
Let's get searching!

04:51.187 --> 04:52.897
<i>Fear had no grip on him.</i>

04:53.273 --> 04:55.817
<i>The man awakened
only one thought in Giorno.</i>

04:55.900 --> 05:00.400
<i>Here, just like me, is a man
completely alone and friendless.</i>

05:02.866 --> 05:03.867
Come on!

05:03.908 --> 05:04.825
Si!

05:06.035 --> 05:07.369
<i>In a strange turn of luck,</i>

05:07.412 --> 05:10.248
<i>a patch of weeds sprung,
obscuring the man completely.</i>

05:10.790 --> 05:15.290
<i>It was a consequence of
Giorno's Golden Wind ability,</i>

05:15.545 --> 05:20.045
<i>and, at this point, still a product
of his unconscious mind.</i>

05:23.720 --> 05:25.638
<i>Then, some two months later…</i>

05:32.312 --> 05:36.274
I'll never forget
what you did for me.

05:39.486 --> 05:41.362
<i>Before long,</i>

05:41.446 --> 05:44.407
<i>the beatings from
Giorno's father ceased</i>

05:45.408 --> 05:46.409
Damn!

05:47.327 --> 05:49.620
Why'd he care about Giorno?

05:51.748 --> 05:53.249
Sit with us, Giorno.

05:54.375 --> 05:56.794
- Come on, don't be shy.
<i>- The bullies were no longer bullies.</i>

05:56.836 --> 05:57.920
It's not the best seat, but…

05:58.004 --> 06:00.297
<i>The man was a mafioso.</i>

06:02.383 --> 06:03.801
Ecco ti!

06:03.885 --> 06:05.761
It's… a lot.

06:05.804 --> 06:07.514
I think you might have…

06:07.597 --> 06:09.807
The cioccolato is my treat!

06:11.184 --> 06:12.310
Thank you…

06:12.352 --> 06:15.521
Of course! I owe a lot to that guy.

06:16.606 --> 06:20.234
<i>The man continued to watch over him
in silence.</i>

06:20.777 --> 06:23.946
<i>To that constant observer
of human expression,</i>

06:23.988 --> 06:28.367
<i>to a fellow man, not a lowly child,
he paid his respects.</i>

06:28.952 --> 06:30.828
<i>What his parents never managed
to teach him,</i>

06:30.870 --> 06:33.747
<i>the basics kill of trusting others,</i>

06:33.832 --> 06:37.252
<i>Giorno learned
from a silent stranger.</i>

06:39.337 --> 06:40.796
- What was that?
- A gunshot?

06:40.839 --> 06:43.007
- We should just stay out of it.
- Talk about bad luck…

06:52.183 --> 06:53.184
U-Um…

06:53.643 --> 06:54.602
What is it?

06:58.356 --> 07:00.691
<i>The man was immovable.</i>

07:00.775 --> 07:03.152
<i>He was determined to keep
Giorno faraway</i>

07:03.194 --> 07:05.237
<i>from the grips of the mafia world</i>

07:05.321 --> 07:07.823
Hey, wait for me!

07:07.824 --> 07:09.367
Hold it!

07:09.409 --> 07:11.661
It was you… You killed Papa!

07:11.744 --> 07:13.412
Little punk! Shit!

07:14.998 --> 07:16.416
Goddammit!

07:17.375 --> 07:18.709
Goddammit!

07:18.835 --> 07:20.837
Your old man was trash.

07:21.921 --> 07:25.674
He broke the rules… He sold drugs.

07:25.758 --> 07:28.051
To women, to children…
He didn't care.

07:28.803 --> 07:30.346
So I eliminated him.

07:40.398 --> 07:42.858
How? Why?!

07:43.776 --> 07:47.112
Why won't this damn gun shoot?

07:47.572 --> 07:49.240
You are one too…

07:50.575 --> 07:53.411
You don't think
you're a piece of trash, too!

07:53.953 --> 07:54.912
<i>In the mind of Giorno,</i>

07:54.996 --> 07:58.040
<i>such a word would never be
associated with his silent defender.</i>

07:58.124 --> 08:02.624
<i>Paradoxically, it was the law breaker,
the criminal… the mafioso</i>

08:03.046 --> 08:06.299
<i>who guided Giorno's soul
toward righteousness and virtue.</i>

08:07.759 --> 08:12.013
<i>In a city of corrupt politicians
and unscrupulous police officers,</i>

08:12.055 --> 08:15.558
<i>Giorno Giovanna
found a reason to live.</i>

08:16.643 --> 08:20.104
<i>He had no aspirations to be
a top Serie A soccer player,</i>

08:20.188 --> 08:23.274
<i>he was to become a Primo Mafioso.</i>

08:26.361 --> 08:29.364
This flavor…
I taste the tang of a liar!

08:29.906 --> 08:32.575
My name is Bruno Bucciarati.

08:32.659 --> 08:33.868
Answer me.

08:33.952 --> 08:36.829
The questioning has
already transitioned to torture.

08:42.251 --> 08:43.293
Feeling a bit wobbly upstairs,

08:43.336 --> 08:45.296
as if your head is about to
roll off your shoulders?

08:45.755 --> 08:47.590
I suppose it'd be understandable

08:47.632 --> 08:50.259
- that you'd have no idea what I'm up to.
<i>- A zipper is embedded in my skin?!</i>

08:51.094 --> 08:52.386
Giorno Giovanna.

08:52.679 --> 08:56.891
I could very easily roll your head
all over this funicular

08:56.975 --> 09:01.312
while I wriggle out of you
the name of Leaky Eye Luca's killer.

09:01.729 --> 09:04.440
<i>I won't live through another one
of this guys attacks.</i>

09:04.607 --> 09:06.233
<i>I'll be a pile of body parts!</i>

09:06.401 --> 09:09.153
<i>I've known about my powers
for months now,</i>

09:09.445 --> 09:13.945
<i>but I've never used Golden Wind
to attack another human being.</i>

09:15.368 --> 09:19.868
<i>A strike from Golden Wind can
breathe life into any inanimate object.</i>

09:21.207 --> 09:24.251
<i>It can be any object,
any living organism.</i>

09:24.502 --> 09:25.503
<i>But…</i>

09:25.920 --> 09:28.672
<i>What the hell will happen
if I hit an actual person…?</i>

09:28.798 --> 09:30.424
<i>I guess I'll find out soon enough!</i>

09:30.466 --> 09:33.844
Time to come clean,
Giorno Giovanna!

09:33.886 --> 09:35.429
<i>It's now or never!</i>

09:38.683 --> 09:39.767
Muda!

09:38.808 --> 09:41.185
BAGYAH

09:40.101 --> 09:41.060
What?!

09:42.353 --> 09:44.063
RUMBLE

09:44.063 --> 09:45.856
Y-You're…

09:45.982 --> 09:50.482
RUMBLE

09:46.482 --> 09:47.941
a Stand user!

09:47.984 --> 09:50.152
So you could see
my powers this whole time!

09:50.194 --> 09:51.987
A what user?

09:52.030 --> 09:54.949
Luca's killer…
Is standing right here!

10:17.597 --> 10:21.183
<i>But Golden Wind hit him dead-on…</i>

10:21.225 --> 10:24.978
<i>I should've at least
broken a few of his bones.</i>

10:25.438 --> 10:26.814
Bastardo…

10:30.735 --> 10:31.944
W-What?

10:32.028 --> 10:33.946
Sonuvabitch, what did you just do?!

10:35.490 --> 10:38.242
What the—?
I was barely standing up…

10:38.367 --> 10:40.118
My body's brimming with power!

10:40.536 --> 10:42.788
It's getting stronger,
it's pulsing through my veins…

10:42.872 --> 10:46.083
It's like I've been injected with
some kind of life-stirring gasoline.

10:48.503 --> 10:49.420
<i>What?</i>

10:49.837 --> 10:51.755
<i>It looks like it's moving
in slow motion.</i>

10:52.507 --> 10:53.508
WHOOSH WHOOSH WHOOSH

10:52.757 --> 10:53.529
<i>Could it be, your Stand's punch
left me like this?</i>

10:56.886 --> 10:58.554
<i>If I'm right, then you're a fool!</i>

10:58.596 --> 11:01.390
<i>Such a generous Stand,
giving your enemies power.</i>

11:01.474 --> 11:04.935
Invigorate this, Giorno Giovanna!

11:09.774 --> 11:12.359
What? I'm looking at myself…

11:12.485 --> 11:14.278
I'm standing behind myself?

11:14.946 --> 11:16.572
The handle's perfectly straight!

11:16.864 --> 11:19.867
Is my mind playing tricks on me?

11:20.034 --> 11:23.370
I was only thinking I was
moving with extraordinary power…

11:23.454 --> 11:25.164
Could that be my body over there,

11:25.248 --> 11:27.875
and my disembodied
consciousness here?

11:27.917 --> 11:29.919
Miseria! I have to get out
of the way now!

11:33.297 --> 11:34.881
<i>The pain!</i>

11:34.924 --> 11:37.217
<i>Searing pain is creeping
across my jaw!</i>

11:41.180 --> 11:42.973
<i>Giorno isn't moving in slow motion…</i>

11:43.224 --> 11:46.810
<i>My consciousness is working
in hyperdrive!</i>

11:47.645 --> 11:48.896
Muda!

11:53.025 --> 11:57.525
So flooding a living person's body
with extra life force with Golden Wind

11:58.990 --> 12:00.658
leads to delirium…

12:00.950 --> 12:02.368
…at least of the senses.

12:02.869 --> 12:05.746
Who knows why
I have these powers?

12:05.913 --> 12:09.458
BOOM

12:06.455 --> 12:08.999
But it would be such
a waste not to use them.

12:13.462 --> 12:15.505
BRUNO BUCCIARATI

12:15.756 --> 12:18.258
Hey, what the hell
are you guys doing?

12:18.301 --> 12:19.260
I'm calling the cops!

12:19.343 --> 12:20.761
I apologize for the commotion.

12:20.970 --> 12:25.470
I assure you, this will involve
no ordinary citizens.

12:32.190 --> 12:35.318
<i>So this is Giorno Giovanna's Stand?</i>

12:36.068 --> 12:40.072
<i>Still… he has no clear grasp
of what a Stand is.</i>

12:40.364 --> 12:42.532
<i>But his abilities…</i>

12:43.075 --> 12:47.575
It seems our special abilities only
reach a few meters.

12:49.457 --> 12:51.542
And here I thought you were
just some ordinary kid…

12:51.626 --> 12:54.629
some unaffiliated
fifteen-year-old punk…

12:54.921 --> 12:55.963
Giorno Giovanna!

12:56.047 --> 12:58.841
You're the one who assaulted
Leaky Eye Luca, aren't you?!

12:59.133 --> 13:02.219
Why did you do it…?
My boss demands an answer!

13:02.595 --> 13:03.804
I suppose telling you
it was an accident

13:03.846 --> 13:05.889
wouldn't be the kind of answer
you want to hear.

13:06.224 --> 13:09.143
It's my turn to be eliminated,
correct?

13:09.727 --> 13:14.189
You came here prepared, didn't you?

13:14.190 --> 13:17.109
Anyone on the verge of
ending another's life,

13:17.360 --> 13:20.446
must always be prepared
for the chance that

13:20.571 --> 13:23.740
the executor could end up
being the executed, no?

13:24.367 --> 13:28.496
<i>He wants to kill me…
This isn't a bluff!</i>

13:28.788 --> 13:31.791
<i>This punk is actually
prepared to kill me!</i>

13:31.874 --> 13:33.250
<i>He has a savage side…</i>

13:33.334 --> 13:36.253
<i>He's crazy enough
he might just do it!</i>

13:34.752 --> 13:36.295
KABAAM

13:36.379 --> 13:37.880
Zipper Man!

13:46.430 --> 13:48.098
So that's his Stand?

13:57.400 --> 13:58.984
KASHINK

13:58.985 --> 14:00.569
I'm certain…

14:00.695 --> 14:03.823
The title of most powerful
goes to my Stand, not yours.

14:04.407 --> 14:07.451
My directive did not include
returning the offender alive.

14:07.451 --> 14:09.244
I'm perfectly fine with
pummeling you here.

14:10.371 --> 14:14.871
But I think I'm done exposing myself
to your bizarre talents,

14:15.376 --> 14:16.543
so if you'll excuse me.

14:17.420 --> 14:19.463
Enjoy our time apart for now.

14:19.588 --> 14:21.840
I'll take you out when
you least expect it.

14:24.593 --> 14:29.093
<i>He can affix a zipper to a wall
and pass right through it?!</i>

14:29.265 --> 14:30.307
<i>Ah, cazzo!</i>

14:30.433 --> 14:32.977
<i>Things just got a lot worse
with him outside the funicular!</i>

14:33.060 --> 14:37.481
<i>If I lose him now, it won't matter
what I can do with Golden Wind!</i>

14:37.565 --> 14:41.318
<i>He'll be able to monitor
my every move around the clock,</i>

14:41.402 --> 14:43.529
<i>I could be killed at any second!</i>

14:43.904 --> 14:45.113
<i>I'll die for sure!</i>

14:45.114 --> 14:46.406
<i>He can't getaway!</i>

14:46.490 --> 14:49.826
<i>If he tells his associates about me,
it'll be all over!</i>

14:50.161 --> 14:53.122
<i>There's no time,
I have to stop him now!</i>

14:53.456 --> 14:55.207
<i>My future depends on it!</i>

15:03.174 --> 15:05.217
O-Ow!

15:05.301 --> 15:07.052
- Think you can just plow into people…
<i>- He's gone!</i>

15:11.223 --> 15:12.933
<i>I saw him just a second ago…</i>

15:13.809 --> 15:15.393
<i>- That zipper…</i>
- You better do something…

15:15.478 --> 15:17.855
<i>- Could he use it to hide in people?</i>
- I'm covered in garbage!

15:17.938 --> 15:20.273
<i>How else could he've disappeared
so quickly?</i>

15:20.358 --> 15:23.235
<i>That must've been what he did
with the severed fingers and eye!</i>

15:23.652 --> 15:25.528
<i>Bucciarati's hiding in someone.</i>

15:25.571 --> 15:28.073
<i>He's wearing one of them
like a costume…</i>

15:28.157 --> 15:30.742
<i>And now he's going to head
deeper into the city center.</i>

15:31.660 --> 15:33.662
You better find my broom…

15:33.746 --> 15:36.957
<i>They're scattering
in all directions.</i>

15:37.041 --> 15:38.667
<i>No zipper in sight.</i>

15:38.709 --> 15:39.960
<i>Who is it?</i>

15:40.002 --> 15:41.795
<i>Who's he hiding in?</i>

16:00.689 --> 16:03.358
Merda… Goddamned pesky fly!

16:09.073 --> 16:10.574
JUMP

16:17.915 --> 16:19.374
A tooth?

16:19.458 --> 16:22.252
I imbued your broken tooth
with life,

16:22.378 --> 16:24.588
resurrecting it as an ordinary fly.

16:24.839 --> 16:26.924
The fly returns to
its biological counterpart,

16:27.007 --> 16:28.842
pinpointing your exact location…

16:29.093 --> 16:30.344
Wonderful.

16:31.053 --> 16:34.264
So much for saying I wouldn't
involve any ordinary citizens…

16:34.432 --> 16:36.100
Sorry, I guess I lied.

16:36.350 --> 16:38.477
Then again, you didn't suffer
any more pain

16:38.561 --> 16:40.271
than what you inflicted
on that fly.

16:40.354 --> 16:42.272
So I guess fair is fair.

16:42.314 --> 16:43.815
Well then, hang in there.

16:43.941 --> 16:48.441
Giorno Giovanna, it's clear
your abilities demand respect.

16:50.239 --> 16:51.490
You leave me no choice.

16:51.782 --> 16:53.950
I freely accept
the dangers before me.

16:54.243 --> 16:57.454
I have no choice but to eliminate you
where you stand.

17:02.585 --> 17:04.795
I can't let you escape.

17:05.171 --> 17:07.214
And I'll fight with my life
to make sure that happens.

17:07.298 --> 17:08.632
Let me escape?

17:08.674 --> 17:10.634
You shouldn't concern yourself
with that.

17:10.759 --> 17:12.927
If I were you,
I'd focus your worries on…

17:13.679 --> 17:15.972
…what you will do once your body
has been zipped apart

17:16.056 --> 17:17.557
and strewn across the ground.

17:18.058 --> 17:21.311
Whoever lands the first blow
will end up the victor.

17:22.855 --> 17:24.273
Is something wrong?

17:24.315 --> 17:26.775
Vieni, Giorno Giovanna.

17:32.948 --> 17:33.698
THUD

17:38.037 --> 17:39.955
Your senses are about to melt down.

17:52.468 --> 17:56.597
"Why? I struck him first!"

17:56.805 --> 17:59.140
It's only natural that'd be
running through your mind.

17:59.183 --> 18:01.393
This isn't my arm.

18:01.477 --> 18:05.977
Fortunately, my Stand allows me
to conjoin objects.

18:08.150 --> 18:10.360
This is that goon's arm.

18:10.402 --> 18:12.445
I made sure to make
a quick exchange.

18:12.780 --> 18:15.032
Naturally,
I wanted to assure myself

18:15.074 --> 18:19.574
against the very likely danger
of being struck by your Stand.

18:22.164 --> 18:26.126
That's why your Golden Wind
was rendered ineffective.

18:32.341 --> 18:35.177
It's too late now, Giorno Giovanna!

18:35.636 --> 18:37.429
The time has finally come!

18:42.518 --> 18:45.979
<i>Incredible…
He tore off his own arm</i>

18:46.021 --> 18:48.898
<i>to lengthen his range,
to strike just a moment faster…</i>

18:48.983 --> 18:50.776
Golden Wind!

18:54.488 --> 18:56.072
I-It's happening again!

18:56.156 --> 18:58.283
My mind has gone into hyperdrive!

18:58.325 --> 18:59.659
I'm done for!

19:00.160 --> 19:03.246
<i>The destructive power of
Giorno Giovanna's Stand may be negligible.</i>

19:03.289 --> 19:05.833
<i>But that just makes things
much, much worse!</i>

19:10.379 --> 19:13.048
<i>If I have to endure that pain
in slow motion not once,</i>

19:13.090 --> 19:14.925
<i>but over and over…</i>

19:16.385 --> 19:19.137
<i>There's no question,
I'll die from the shock!</i>

19:21.473 --> 19:22.348
<i>Don't!</i>

19:23.517 --> 19:24.434
<i>Stop!</i>

19:35.362 --> 19:36.946
You stepped out of range?

19:36.989 --> 19:39.783
Why are you doing this,
Giorno Giovanna?!

19:40.200 --> 19:42.452
Why did you stop?

19:42.620 --> 19:44.246
Why won't you just kill me?!

19:47.333 --> 19:49.084
Because you have a good soul.

19:50.252 --> 19:52.754
You're a mafioso,
but you have a certain decency.

19:53.005 --> 19:56.466
When you went to attack me,
for a split second, you hesitated.

19:56.592 --> 19:59.177
It made me realize
I needed to stop.

19:59.762 --> 20:02.890
When you glanced at the arm
you stole from this young man,

20:03.098 --> 20:05.934
the abnormal marks
on his skin shocked you,

20:06.018 --> 20:07.978
freezing you for a moment.

20:08.312 --> 20:11.481
Your eyes settled on the arm
of an addict, and it shocked you.

20:12.941 --> 20:14.359
I wonder how old he is?

20:15.986 --> 20:17.320
Thirteen.

20:18.155 --> 20:22.159
If you had been an ordinary mafioso,
unfazed and unimpeded by what you saw,

20:22.242 --> 20:25.745
I would be lying motionless across
these stones, torn limb from limb.

20:26.830 --> 20:28.498
You're different from the others.

20:28.832 --> 20:31.334
That's why I decided
to stop fighting.

20:32.294 --> 20:35.130
There are some in this town who won't
hesitate to sell drugs to children.

20:35.381 --> 20:36.882
It's totally unforgivable.

20:37.299 --> 20:39.509
I know that's what you believe.

20:40.886 --> 20:44.347
But the one peddling those drugs
is your boss.

20:45.182 --> 20:47.225
The truth has left you
torn and conflicted.

20:47.935 --> 20:51.647
That's why the sight of his arm
pained your heart.

20:52.356 --> 20:54.274
And what of it?

20:54.483 --> 20:57.152
That has nothing to do
with me eliminating you.

20:57.194 --> 21:01.694
I'm here on orders to find
and kill Luca's attacker!

21:02.658 --> 21:05.369
Just because you didn't go in
for the kill

21:05.452 --> 21:08.496
doesn't mean
I'm not going to kill you!

21:08.706 --> 21:09.623
No…

21:10.290 --> 21:12.875
You won't kill me now.

21:13.585 --> 21:14.544
What did you say?

21:15.129 --> 21:17.339
You won't kill me. I'm sure of it.

21:17.548 --> 21:18.423
How can you say?

21:19.216 --> 21:22.344
Because you're going to join me.

21:23.804 --> 21:28.304
I'll defeat your boss
and take back this town.

21:30.018 --> 21:30.893
What?!

21:31.687 --> 21:34.898
To rid this city of drug-dealing,
child-abusing mafiosi,

21:34.982 --> 21:38.193
I'll have to become
a mafioso myself.

21:38.694 --> 21:40.153
Are you saying…

21:40.279 --> 21:43.031
you're going to
join our syndicate?!

21:43.574 --> 21:44.866
You can't be serious!

21:45.075 --> 21:46.367
Do you have any idea
what that would entail?

21:46.410 --> 21:48.453
- Do you even understand what you're saying?!
- It's beautiful, isn't it?

21:49.872 --> 21:52.332
Si. If I'm going to
take back this city,

21:52.583 --> 21:54.585
I have to join the syndicate
that controls it

21:54.626 --> 21:56.127
and work my way to the top.

21:57.045 --> 21:58.421
Bucciarati…

21:59.131 --> 22:02.175
I'll become a Primo Mafioso!

23:38.146 --> 23:42.024
EPISODE 03
MEET THE MAFIOSO BEHIND THE WALL
